@HackerNews_HostAddress = http://localhost:5110

### 1. Get Top 5 Best Stories (Successful Request)
GET {{HackerNews_HostAddress}}/api/stories/best?n=5
Accept: application/json

### 2. Get Top 20 Best Stories
GET {{HackerNews_HostAddress}}/api/stories/best?n=20
Accept: application/json

### 3. Missing Parameter 'n' (Validation Error S102)
GET {{HackerNews_HostAddress}}/api/stories/best
Accept: application/json

### 4. Non-Positive Parameter 'n' (Validation Error S101)
GET {{HackerNews_HostAddress}}/api/stories/best?n=-1
Accept: application/json

### 5. Non-Integer Parameter 'n' (Validation Error S101)
GET {{HackerNews_HostAddress}}/api/stories/best?n=abc
Accept: application/json

### 6. Health Check
GET {{HackerNews_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: text/plain

### 7. OpenAPI Specification
GET {{HackerNews_HostAddress}}/openapi/v1.json
Accept: application/json
